From 63e8eab68ac777f6efbe11659066989cbb324534 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Miures Manager <contact@miures.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 14:47:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 06-10-2026 workbook, Embedded Data URLs, one question content
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

All seven workbook items and both explicit requirements, mapped in
docs/OCT06-REVIEW-2026-10-07.md.

- One question content: the Text Editor writes question.text (and the
  instruction); the redundant "HTML Content" field and "Custom HTML above
  the input" are gone. Legacy customHtml is migrated on every parse
  (normalizeQuestionContent, a z.preprocess on Question): a Text / HTML
  block's HTML becomes its text (a builder-only label kept in notes), any
  other type's goes into its instruction; a Custom Component keeps its
  template.
- HTML with its own CSS in question text renders like the block: the
  author's <style> is kept (Word's still removed), made safe, unwrapped
  from a pasted page and scoped to the question (scopedHtml.ts) — in the
  editor, the preview, Test Survey and the live survey, with device-preview
  media queries. The block's CSS no longer restyles the page.
- Embedded Data value type URL: kept byte for byte, validated as http(s),
  a URL field that starts a redirect is the address itself, release lint
  blocks a fixed/default value its type cannot read.
- Layout: no "Auto (Fit Width)"; one column by default, 1–5 offered,
  layoutColumns() shared by builder and renderers.
- Insert Media: several items get a layout (vertical default, horizontal,
  grid 1–4, carousel with ← →), gap and alignment; fits Original / Custom.
- Date/Time Range: renamed, no placeholders, one range type and one format
  (10 date, 4 time) for both ends.
- Numeric: custom text left/right in every subtype; Currency's typed symbol
  removed (the selected currency wins); Numeric List per-field text and
  system-sized boxes.
- Leftover-field check no longer flags settings the shape table does not
  own (Currency's own currency was offered for deletion).

Tests: engine 1699, studio 263, all packages green; new browser suite
oct06-review-test; 29/29 mutations caught; 114/127 browser suites pass,
the rest environmental or identical on the previous commit.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QAcfUsJLu3R4pYxzaj9SU4
